              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='89600' id='6' type-v2='empty' w='3217' x='96212' y='9600'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='89600' id='7' type-v2='empty' w='3211' x='571' y='9600'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8800' id='10' type-v2='text' w='70857' x='14786' y='800'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='15'>Purpose &amp; Objectives</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='6' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='6' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d61f26' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8800' id='12' type-v2='text' w='13786' x='85643' y='800'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='5' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='6' />
              <format attr='margin-right' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='6' />
              <format attr='margin-left' value='0' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d61f26' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='3200' id='13' type-v2='empty' w='46218' x='3782' y='9600'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='20400' id='14' type-v2='text' w='92430' x='3782' y='12800'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Purpose</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>This dashboard was designed to measure and evaluate candidate experience for DHSE. It focuses on the survey item asking &quot;How likely would you be to recommend others to apply for a job at {org}?&quot; and candidates&apos; responses to this question. Questions with numeric responses (i.e. scaled 1-10 or 1-5) as well as &apos;Yes / No&apos; questions are also analysed.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>It was created at the request of recruiting leadership. All in the  TA org will have access to the dashboard with user filters applied (i.e. users will be able to see only the data relevant to them). </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='54600' id='15' type-v2='text' w='92430' x='3782' y='33200'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Objectives</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>The dashboard was created to answer the following commonly asked questions:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>1. What is the likelihood that a candidate would recommend others to apply for a job at DHSE?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>2. How many candidates were promoters / passives / detractors overall?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>3. How does candidate experience develop over time?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>4. What is the breakdown of promoters / passives / detractors in each department? </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>5. What is the breakdown of promoters / passives / detractors in each cost center? </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>6. What is the breakdown of promoters / passives / detractors in each management track and level? </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>7.  What is the breakdown of promoters / passives / detractors for requisitions under each hiring manager?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>8. How do candidates feel about the duration of the interview process?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>9. How do candidates feel about the ease of the interview process?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
